{"title":"1985 AJHSME Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume every 7-digit whole number is a possible telephone number except those that begin with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  What fraction of telephone numbers begin with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and end with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/5/3d5dae65758242b82138d21bc2025f4cf9c19861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{63} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\frac{1}{80} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\frac{1}{81} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\frac{1}{90} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\frac{1}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"403\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><i>Note: All telephone numbers are 7-digit whole numbers.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4b0967e092a1b36fa1c8ce02c71b7ab503b3b21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\cdot 10^6$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" /> possible phone numbers. The first number is 9 and the last number is 0, so two numbers are fixed, making it so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/d/e7d8b576968ccdbfeff38053b7c606905adb945e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"24\" height=\"15\" /> numbers satisfy the conditions. So, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/8/378d0792e876c6793517c092efeb16c3e18a7615.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10^5}{8 \\cdot 10^6} = \\boxed{\\frac{1}{80}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"113\" height=\"48\" /> The answer is B.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018042946\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 39/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1584/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:20578:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018042946 and revision id 144267. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}